      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The cgroup v2 `io` controller manages block I/O resources for processes.",
      "source_hash": 982057133929389458,
      "context_hash": 3383143004155737440,
      "translation": "cgroup v2 `io` 컨트롤러는 프로세스의 블록 I/O 자원을 관리합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "cgroup": "cgroup",
        "controller": "컨트롤러",
        "processes": "프로세스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:55:04.542606Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It provides:",
      "source_hash": 1075123997003473049,
      "context_hash": 2121816708144262416,
      "translation": "제공하는 기능은 다음과 같습니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:55:04.542607Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "**io.max**: hard rate limits (bytes/sec, IOPS)",
      "source_hash": 6722895873037448268,
      "context_hash": 15040554074173636291,
      "translation": "**io.max**: 하드 속도 제한(바이트/sec, IOPS)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "IOPS": "IOPS",
        "byte": "바이트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:27:33.573757Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**io.weight**: proportional share scheduling (WFQ)",
      "source_hash": 2219110913541149677,
      "context_hash": 7925969822525843582,
      "translation": "**io.weight**: 비례 배분 스케줄링(WFQ)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "scheduling": "스케줄링"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:55:04.542607Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "**io.latency**: latency SLA enforcement (evict excess I/O to protect latency) [(commit)](https://git.kernel.org/linus/d70675121546c35feaceebf7ed9caed8716640f3) [(LWN)](https://lwn.net/Articles/758963/)",
      "source_hash": 12922472188193444303,
      "context_hash": 16796856368144912309,
      "translation": "**io.latency**: 지연 시간 SLA 강제(지연 시간을 보호하기 위해 초과 I/O를 축출) [(커밋)](https://git.kernel.org/linus/d70675121546c35feaceebf7ed9caed8716640f3) [(LWN)](https://lwn.net/Articles/758963/)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "LWN": "LWN",
        "latency": "지연 시간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:55:04.542607Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
