      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T21:55:04.542607Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Introduced in Linux 4.19 by Josef Bacik [(commit)](https://git.kernel.org/linus/d70675121546c35feaceebf7ed9caed8716640f3) [(LWN)](https://lwn.net/Articles/758963/).",
      "source_hash": 2656776965045090361,
      "context_hash": 4323251874818805579,
      "translation": "Linux 4.19에서 Josef Bacik이 도입했습니다 [(커밋)](https://git.kernel.org/linus/d70675121546c35feaceebf7ed9caed8716640f3) [(LWN)](https://lwn.net/Articles/758963/).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "LWN": "LWN",
